  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Network of Local Governments II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to support and enable citizen participation in public and political decision-making, to lead to the creation of responsive, accountable and transparent institutions that can deliver quality-level services. 

Outcome 1: Increased participation of Jordanian vulnerable groups in the electoral, political, democratic space and decision-making processes.
Outcome 2 :Strengthened coordination between central, local governments and communities for inclusive and participatory 
Outcome 3: Enhanced access to quality health and psycho-social care, including residential homes and shelters for vulnerable groups.</narrative>
  </description>
